{"pageid":3373,"title":"Air Ship","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Air Ship</span>","revid":21083,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/89/Airship.png/revision/latest?cb=20241013045956\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This is the default airship.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/89/Airship.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241013045956\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"101\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Airship.png\" data-image-key=\"Airship.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Airship.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">This is the default airship.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The Air Ship is a vehicle that not a lot of people know how to use. Its controlled with WASD and LSHIFT/LCONTROL, LSHIFT and LCONTROL are for going up and down, W/S are forward and backward, A/D is steering, the airship has tank steer meaning it will always have the same rotational control no matter which direction you are moving, and can turn at any time.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>Airship can’t be used to transport cargo.\n</p><p>It is only available on testing servers.\n</p><p>It’s maximum speed is 35 studs per second.\n</p><p>It is SLOW. <a href=\"/wiki/Oakmobile\" title=\"Oakmobile\">Oakmobile</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/OptimusVehicle\" title=\"OptimusVehicle\">Optimus Vehicle</a> are better for general purposes.\n</p><p>It can be found at the oak depot behind the register\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902105924\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3373-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902105924 and revision id 21083. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Oakmobile","exists":true},{"title":"OptimusVehicle","exists":true}],"images":["Airship.png"]}
